WEBVTT

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.160
Looks like the deposits are befitting of its size.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.130
And it's high purity Orichalt, too.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:19.250
We can't be sure of anything
until we properly investigate it.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.800
But someone was already digging it.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:26.060
Knowing you, you've already made
arrangements, haven't you.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.920
Aren't you impatient.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.580
That's not good for your blood pressure.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.480
Well, I shall be waiting then.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.300
Look forward to it.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.200
The rainy season is coming soon...

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.970
It's absolutely unbelievable.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.860
Yes, that's why I want you to take a look.

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:03.760
Please tell me if you notice something.

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:09.650
Orichalt containment unit has stabilized.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:11.180
Tell me its composition.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.240
Orichalt purity is...

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.640
100%?!

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.260
There it is! The 777 jackpot!

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.100
Wait a second...

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:20.320
Atmospheric pressure is rising
inside the observation chamber.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.240
What?!

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:22.730
The lights are...

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:23.760
Warp phenomenon?

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.380
There's an abnormality in
the containment unit...

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:28.220
The pressure... Rose to habitable levels.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.410
T-There!

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:33.930
Huh?

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:34.940
What's going on?

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:35.780
Cute...

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:37.040
That's not the issue here.

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:41.320
There at the end...

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.320
That was Mr. Ido?

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:43.370
Yeah.

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:45.090
He was too surprised.

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:49.440
That's a rare sight, for him to show emotions.

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:52.680
But he had already calmed down when you came.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:54.650
Well, that really was surprising.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:58.010
Who'd think a girl would appear
from the Orichalt...

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:41.520
She's not even wearing a space suit...

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.100
Karla, what's going on?

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.420
What, it's not like I get it either.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.860
The warp phenomenon caused by Orichalt.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:51.070
In that case that illusion must have been...

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:58.560
Did her consciousness bypass the MT system and flow directly to me?

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.480
That can't be.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.560
And besides...

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:06.590
Why did it make me feel so afraid?

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.480
Afraid, no, that's not it.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:10.640
Guilt...

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:12.400
Guilty?

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:13.760
Me?

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.070
Don't look at me!

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:16.820
Don't look at me with those pitying eyes!

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:18.790
You're the one who betrayed us!

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.640
You beast!

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:22.400
What is it?

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:24.960
My...

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.070
Memories?

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.140
There's a gravitational wave from
an imminent Miguel Jump!

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.230
Is someone doing a Miguel Out?

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:34.830
Who?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.430
Why in this location?

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.790
I caught a warning signal from
an advance probe!

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:39.760
The Federation?

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:43.630
That's-

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:47.710
Well look at that, one of the Planetary
Federation's military interstellar ships.

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.100
Spatial transfer, complete.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.680
Retrieving advance probe.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.430
Deploying spatial mesh with
Vega as the base coordinate.

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:55.960
Combined search sensors locked on to target.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:58.520
This is Contact, commence operation.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.980
This is Recon 01, roger.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:03.940
All units, let's finish this mission quickly.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.990
83rd reconnaissance-in-force company,

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:13.910
moving out!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:17.760
Papa, their ship is forcibly approaching ours!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.870
Without even signaling us to stop?!

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.740
So they intend to just hold us
up no questions asked then.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.280
Don't screw with us!

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:26.790
We're not going down that easily!

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:27.500
Clair!

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:28.910
Emergency jump!

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.420
I don't care where you take us!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:31.000
Got it!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.420
Rick! Ido!

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.160
Got it.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.720
We'll scatter rocks to buy us time.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:36.940
What, we're leaving the goods here?

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.060
If they catch us, they'll know who we are.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.510
Oh, well that would be bad.

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:42.230
Alrighty, scatter around!

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:46.520
Target has released a large number of mineral-like objects in your direction.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:49.740
Recon 01, use of S2 strategy is permitted.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:50.640
Roger that.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:54.480
Time until Orichalt release from
containment device is 170 seconds!

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.910
The Federation ship deployed troops!

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.400
Recon 01, advancing.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:11.820
Detecting a gravity wave from
the high-speed object!

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:13.360
Orichalt torpedoes?

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:18.310
What the hell?

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.310
A short jump.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.500
Now that's cheeky!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.600
Commencing apprehension.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.200
Oh no, they're going to break
through these too!

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:33.820
Resistance is...

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.710
Resistance is futile.
Disarm yourselves.

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:50.160
Otherwise we'll disable your ship!

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:51.520
I repeat!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.080
Stop the resistance and disarm
yourselves immediately!

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.280
Otherwise we'll disable your ship!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.580
Obey the Federation military's orders!

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.070
I repeat!

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:02.910
Stop the resistance and disarm
yourselves immediately!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.510
Otherwise we'll disable your ship!

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:06.940
You there.

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:08.200
What's your name?

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:10.240
Ido.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:11.960
Ido, huh.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.700
I'll remember that name.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:32.120
Physical connection to the target
ship established via wires.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.520
The system has been successfully taken over.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.150
We have full authority over it.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:38.150
Target ship has been seized.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.190
The inspection team has boarded the ship.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.100
So what are we supposed to be guilty of?

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:47.200
Where's the Orichalt you've
excavated from the new planet?

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.260
I'm asking you, what are the charges?

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.630
We'd like to avoid any further harm.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.590
All right, all right.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:55.560
Man...

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:58.520
Observation chamber in block 32.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:07:59.750
Right.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.180
So they're after the Orichalt
from the new planet, after all.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:09.520
But why are they doing it so forcibly?

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:12.630
Maya, If they find her...

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.230
I really hope she's hiding somewhere.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:16.460
No talking!

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:18.780
Out of the ship, all of you!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.080
Good, this is it.

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.240
Let's ask the guys outside for help.

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:25.000
But is this really all of it?

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:29.140
No idea whether it is,
but the orders are to retrieve it.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.840
How long are you gonna stay in the machine?

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.560
Hurry up and Mind Out.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:37.460
I can't.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:39.520
Still trying to resist?!

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:42.980
Mr. Ido is an Evertrancer.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.840
That's why, uh...

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.820
Even if he wanted to Mind Out, he can't do it.

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:51.080
Ever... trancer?

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:56.470
A being that abandoned their body and left their consciousness in the I-Machine...

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.540
But that's a serious crime!

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.230
I'm the same, by the way.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.710
Same here, ditto.

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:04.560
Huh?! All of you?

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.580
Oh? We didn't tell you?

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:07.880
Me too.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.740
We all have our circumstances.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:15.400
Evertrancer... First time seeing one.

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.720
Why did you abandon your bodies?

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.000
Longed for a mechanical body?

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:22.180
Seeking eternal life?

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:23.550
Neither of those.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.270
It's all artificial.

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:28.110
And you still call yourself human?

00:09:28.340 --> 00:09:30.200
That's not for me to decide.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.580
It's about who you perceive me to be.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.640
Going all philosophical, huh.

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:41.320
Pleased to meet you, captain Jake Hojo.

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:44.520
Or, rather, former captain.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.550
Captain?

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:48.870
It's a great honor to meet you, former captain-

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.880
What are the charges against us?

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:53.950
You're accused of illegal mining
on the new planet.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.200
Illegal mining?

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:58.710
We accepted a formal request
from Planet Works!

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:03.440
There is no company called "Planet
Works" anywhere in this universe.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:04.520
No way!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:07.740
To think I'd fail to notice the
information was fake...

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:13.670
But still, to think the former captain
was still sailing through the universe.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:20.710
Was losing a state of the art ship and
740 subordinates not enough for you?

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:25.900
Now you're even dragging your daughter
into this, that doesn't seem sane at all.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:26.760
It's all right.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:29.220
I'm doing it because I like it.

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.230
Same goes for your crew.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:34.460
Former top racer whose body
was paralyzed in an accident.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:39.720
Former fund manager who exercised outstanding
talent in the space resource market.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:45.920
A wild animal from the endangered
species of the Cetus constellation.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.270
An animal?

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.380
All of you Evertrancers,

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:55.430
going not only against Federation law,
but even the taboos of bioethics.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:59.880
But there is an even more interesting specimen.

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:02.500
And then there's you.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:08.710
Machine number, consciousness mapping,
we can't find your ID no matter the approach.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.510
An unknown...

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:14.180
Basically, you don't exist in this world.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.710
I exist right here.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.960
So who are you?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.780
That's what I'd like to know.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.180
Watch your mouth.

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:25.400
That was a serious answer, though.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:31.420
Um, we were just mining as per per the
accepted request! We're not lying!

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:37.030
If there was some kind of mistake, we'll hand
over all of the excavated Orichalt! So please...

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:38.660
Let you go?

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:40.150
I can't do that.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.910
Especially you.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:43.660
Mikuri Maya.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:47.520
Wanted for illegally providing
asteroid information for

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:51.150
scientific use of the Federation Academy
to the Fujima Corporation.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:55.040
That's wrong! I'm innocent! Really!

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:58.260
Whether that's true or not will be
decided during the investigation.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.840
The Orichalt has been retrieved.

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.600
And, well...

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:03.640
What is it?

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.560
Actually, we found someone still on board.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.100
That girl...

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:14.830
They found her.

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:17.100
The orders are to restrain her.

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:19.070
Hey, you! Don't struggle!

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.260
Damn, causing so much trouble.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.820
I've heard the news.

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:59.040
Looks like they retrieved the Orichalt dug up at that new planet, then.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:02.260
But isn't the amount a bit low?

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.320
What a miscalculation.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.960
I bet the mining company is just trying to fool us.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:10.680
Guess we'll have the military get it together then.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:13.160
Should I put in a word?

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:14.470
Please don't joke around like that.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.880
That's my job.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:22.590
There should be more Orichalt
you've dug up from that new planet!

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.310
Where are you hiding it?

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:27.160
The one in block 32 was all of it.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.790
If it's not enough for you,

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:30.680
fly over there and dig some yourselves.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.220
Papa!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:33.270
You bastard!

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:34.040
Don't move!

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:36.520
You certainly have some direct methods.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.920
In the military, orders are absolute.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.880
Just like for robots then.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.320
Trying to be ironic?

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.790
As if a machine like you could-

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.110
A gravity wave?

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.180
Detecting a gravity wave from
an imminent Miguel Out.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.600
Estimated mass...

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.550
Half the mass of the Moon!

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:54.280
What?

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:55.950
Is it a man-made object?

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.220
Multiple objects inbound!

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:58.780
Materialized in normal space!

00:13:58.870 --> 00:13:59.790
Those are...

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:01.340
Celestial bodies!

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.550
A natural phenomenon?

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.440
Are these asteroids heading here?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.440
Strictly speaking, not asteroids.

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:08.360
The hell?

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.030
This isn't good.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.000
Is this your work too?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:14.550
Sorry, but we're not that omnipotent.

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.860
What's happening?

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:20.180
What kind of phenomenon is this?

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:21.070
Why?

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:22.030
Think about it later!

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.070
Into the ship, right now!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:24.960
You bastard, who let you give orders?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.630
Who gives a damn about orders?

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.140
You want to die or what?

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.520
Begin evasive maneuvers!

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:31.300
All hands, brace for impact!

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:32.640
Moving objects spotted!

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:34.150
Time until collision:

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:35.120
16...

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.220
15...

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.040
14...

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.390
13...

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:39.180
12...

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.150
11...

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.060
10...

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:42.040
9...

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:43.180
8...

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:44.260
7...

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:45.100
6...

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.200
5...

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.340
4...

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:48.440
3...

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:49.360
2...

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.430
1...

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.150
Maya!

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:05.340
Go back to the ship.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.460
Mr. Ido!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:10.200
Wait!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:11.230
Where are you going?

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:14.950
Dammit!

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:15.880
That brat!

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:28.270
Lieutenant!

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.400
We can't do this!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.710
There's too many of them!

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.110
Quit your whining!

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.550
Pops, can't we run off with just the Stulti?

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:37.800
As if!

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:40.640
They took over our systems!

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:42.540
Could it be...

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:43.430
That girl!

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:45.400
Thank goodness, she's okay.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:48.150
Come here!

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:49.510
Uh, um...!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.200
Permitting use of weapons
against the mining company.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:53.660
Focus on securing the target!

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:55.140
What was that, you bastards!

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:02.710
If you don't wanna die,
get the hell out of my ship!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.310
You okay?

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:10.180
Hahaha, the hell is she laughing about?

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.750
Boss, we're detecting more gravity waves.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:15.640
There'll be a whole lot more coming!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.440
What?

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.080
Hey, hey, hey!

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.900
What are we going to do with this?

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.670
We can't jump away!

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:25.740
Let's leave that to the military.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.100
Are they going to jump?

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.990
We've got things to be doing ourselves.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:36.160
Time until moving objects enter
the Miguel Field: 0277.

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:39.070
Commencing emergency Miguel Jump
along with the captured ship.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:45.620
Damage report!

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:47.220
What is the state of the disabled ship?

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:48.630
Physical connection is normal.

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:50.160
Navigation systems seized.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:54.740
Recon 01, continue guarding the captured ship!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.500
Recon 01, roger.

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.980
Where... did they go?

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.980
Should we look for them on board?

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:06.070
Do it.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:17.960
I see.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.680
So that means.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:24.120
Can't take my eyes off for a second.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.160
Ido!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.660
What is this about doing a Miguel Jump
at the moment of the explosion?

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.620
We're in the middle of a jump right now!

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.420
Theoretically it should be possible.

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:34.600
Theoretically?

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:36.340
If it fails, we'll die!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.300
Same thing as staying here.

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:41.790
And I'd rather choose my fate myself.

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:43.720
Mr. Ido...

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:45.880
Wait, Maya!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.020
Alright, time to detonate these and esca-

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:54.240
I'm not going to let you.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.510
Face forward and raise your hands.

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:00.300
Can't you hear me?

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.740
Slowly turn around.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:12.190
Slowly.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.430
The detonation switch?

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:22.630
Drop it.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:23.600
I refuse.

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.880
The next one will go right
through your brain unit.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.740
And that'll be the end of you.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:30.990
So what?

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:35.120
Don't try to show off when you're still
clinging to life despite being an Evertrancer.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:36.920
You robot bastard.

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:38.630
It's not like I'm clinging to life.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.200
But a reason for dying?

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:41.960
What?

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:43.150
I can't think of any.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:46.070
Everyone!

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.460
Run away, please!

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:50.270
Well done, little lady!

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:52.190
Fa-Loser!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:56.720
Not going to shoot?

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:59.550
Well, it's not like it matters.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:09.990
Retrieval of administrator rights
over our systems confirmed!

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:12.480
Grayman!

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:16.310
I got it, you damn adventurer.

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:18.030
Miguel Jump!

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:18.750
Got it!

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:20.840
Stopping the containment mechanism!

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:22.150
Releasing Orichalt!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.390
We lost their ship!

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:30.980
They appear to have Miguel Jumped!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:34.150
Because of the second jump there's an
abnormality in the spatial calculations!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:36.020
There's a major error in the navigation system!

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:46.060
Return to ordinary space, complete!

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:47.440
We did it!

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.020
We did it, Papa!

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:50.900
Somehow, I guess.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.220
Respond!

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:00.000
Someone! Someone!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.580
This is Recon 01!

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:02.630
Requesting a response!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:06.220
Looks like you're the only one who
Miguel Jumped with us, then.

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:09.070
What are you going to do?

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:16.840
Do whatever you want.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.540
You saved us, little lady!

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:21.840
That was a surprise!

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:24.110
To think Maya would attack them.

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:25.800
I kind of lost myself there...

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:26.950
Do you get it?

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:28.670
You picked a fight with the military.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:32.020
Now you're a full-fledged fugitive.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:32.550
Eh?

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:36.360
What am I gonna do?!

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:36.800
Huh?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.540
An emergency rescue signal?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.580
Is she supposed to be crazy or responsible?

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:46.710
I don't dislike that.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:48.720
Reminds me of someone else.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:52.470
Found it!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.750
That girl...

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:02.180
What a crazy woman.

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:03.580
I thank you for retrieving my body.

00:23:06.390 --> 00:23:07.260
But...

00:23:08.370 --> 00:23:10.260
I'm not going to forget this humiliation.

00:23:10.260 --> 00:23:11.950
Woah, woah, woah.

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:14.670
This officer here is a total beauty!

00:23:14.670 --> 00:23:16.790
W-We picked up...

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:19.090
One hell of a treasure!

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:22.400
What are you looking at, you bastard?

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:31.440
To make a living, we sink into the vessel
called society and live as in a cage.

00:23:31.440 --> 00:23:34.760
Is that used for good or evil?

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:39.650
Now the false peace falls,
and pure ambition fills the hearts.
